ystem for power infrastructure O&M. Conducts large-scale surveys and tower inspections in complex terrains.</li><li>Modular design supports HD zoom cameras, thermal sensors, and LiDAR. Key applications: autonomous inspection of high-voltage lines, defect recognition, substation monitoring, and 3D modeling for clearance planning.</li><li>Figure 1 FC-DLXJ-01 Drone</li><li>Technical Specs</li><li>Application Scenarios</li><li>Real-time power channel inspection</li><li>Ortho/Oblique imaging inspection</li><li>LiDAR channel inspection</li></ul>"}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"specs","className":"detail-section","style":{"padding":"80px 0","backgroundColor":"#fff"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"section-title","style":{"textAlign":"center","marginBottom":"50px","fontSize":"3.6rem","fontWeight":700},"children":"Technical Specifications"}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"border":"1px solid #eee","overflowX":"auto"},"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"spec-table","style":{"width":"100%","borderCollapse":"collapse","minWidth":"600px"},"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"style":{"background":"#f4f7fa","color":"#333","borderBottom":"2px solid #315ba4"},"children":[["$","th",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","textAlign":"left","fontSize":"1.6rem","fontWeight":"bold"},"children":"Parameter"}],["$","th",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","textAlign":"left","fontSize":"1.6rem","fontWeight":"bold"},"children":"Description"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"style":{"background":"#fff","borderBottom":"1px solid #eee"},"children":[["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontWeight":"bold","width":"45%","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"Aircraft Material"}],["$","td",null,{"style":{"padding":"20px 30px","fontSize":"1.5rem"},"children":"Advanced Aviation Composites"}]]}],["$","tr","1",{"style":{"background":"#fafafa","borderBottom":"1px solid #eee"},"children":[["$","t